WEBVTT

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:06.200
These baby raccoons were found abandoned

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.100
near a home.

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:11.680
Nugget is learning how to climb trees.

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:16.840
Princess was neglected by her owner.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.920
Socks is an orphan.

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:26.040
Frank was found abandoned.

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:31.500
Prince's hooves are in bad shape.
